# Scarborough Fair: the traditional English ballad (Child 2), words and air from Kidson,
# Traditional Tunes (1891), pp. 42-44: the Whitby street singer's tune, in G major. Not the
# 1947 Mark Anderson (Dorian) tune or the 1960s arrangements.
